es to  finance the russian army which  essentially is committing a genocide of  the ukrainian people by massacring  civilians every single day uh every  single day i wake up to the news that  more and more civilians were killed  there are more civilian losses in  ukraine than military losses that says  something about the type of warfare they  are waging it's a terrorist state waging  a terrorist war against an independent  nation and they must be stopped with all  means and money and economic sanctions  are  very strongly towards them  um it's absolutely horrific what you say  and i just want to talk a bit about the  position you find yourself in and we  might better show a picture of you i  believe  um you've uh taken up  a gun yourself and you say that you're  prepared  to use it  you've got three children including a  nine-month-old  just just talk me through you're in  strasbourg at the moment are you  planning on returning to ukraine at your  children in ukraine what's your own  situation  uh so my my own situation is complicated  you know how you you put the  on your social media profile it's  complicated this is my situation right  now uh  i'm uh very blessed to be in a much  better position than many people living  in besieged towns such as well navajo  which has been destroyed yesterday since  yesterday it's a town in ukraine which  had one hundred and thousand one hundred  thousand people and now it's no longer  considered livable it's no longer a town  uh  yesterday it was the last day that city  was existing as a city so i guess i'm  lucky that that at least i'm living  breathing i'm in safety i'm in a country  right now where there is no war where  missiles are not flying my kids are in  safety uh i in fact have a couple of  hours with them uh  just now just as we speak so uh i'm  extremely blessed that i have the  opportunity to at least see them for for  at least a while but uh once this  diplomatic mission to strasbourg is over  that's it i go back 